e2e core/skills/ai-dlc-update/reconcile/pull.sh stub-pm why=pull.sh has no entry function, so its merge runs start as a program; the merge path reads no reconcile/lib.sh memo (pull.sh never sources lib.sh, readopt-override.sh is its own child at BASH_SUBSHELL 0); converting needs pull.sh wrapped as an entry function driven by inproc_run, a bootstrapping change that ships alone; the merge relays the readopt-override.sh child's refusal and exit
